---
// Four checks distinguishing a genuine low-P/E bargain from a P/E = 6x value trap.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 265;
---
<figure class="sbp7-vt">
  <div class="sbp7-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparing a true P/E = 6x compounder (recurring core earnings, positive CFO, healthy balance sheet) against a P/E = 6x value trap (one-off asset sale, cyclical margin peak, bloated receivables, or heavy dilution risk).">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp7-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>When you spot a "P/E = 6x" stock: real bargain or classic value trap?</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khi thấy cổ phiếu "P/E = 6 lần": món hời thật hay chiếc bẫy giá rẻ?</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Left: Real bargain */}
      <rect x="20" y="54" width="420" height="190" rx="10" class="sbp7-card-green" />
      <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={48} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="74" y="88" class="sbp7-hdr sbp7-green">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Genuine Low-P/E Value (16.7% E/P)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hàng rẻ thật (Tỷ suất E/P = 16,7%)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="122" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Earnings come from core steady business</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Lãi đến từ bán hàng cốt lõi ổn định</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="150" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• CFO tracks profit &amp; cash dividends arrive</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• CFO theo kịp lãi &amp; chia cổ tức tiền thật</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="38" y="178" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Low debt + fair governance, neglected price</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Nợ vay nhẹ + quản trị sạch, giá bị lãng quên</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right: Value trap */}
      <rect x="460" y="54" width="420" height="190" rx="10" class="sbp7-card-red" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={488} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="514" y="88" class="sbp7-hdr sbp7-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Classic "Low P/E" Value Trap</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bẫy "P/E rẻ giả tạo"</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="122" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Trailing E inflated by one-off land/sub sale</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Mẫu số E bị phồng nhờ bán đất/công ty con</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="150" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Peak commodity cycle margins ready to drop</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Đỉnh chu kỳ hàng hóa sắp đảo chiều giảm</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="478" y="178" class="sbp7-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Dying moat, bad debt, or heavy annual ESOP</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Mất thị phần, nợ xấu hoặc pha loãng ESOP dày</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The market often prices a 6x P/E for a reason: verify whether the denominator `E` is repeatable core cash flow before buying a "cheap" multiple.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Thị trường hiếm khi vô tình để P/E ở mức 6 lần: luôn kiểm tra xem mẫu số `E` có phải dòng tiền bền vững hay sắp biến mất trước khi xuống tiền.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp7-vt { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp7-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp7-vt svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp7-vt text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp7-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp7-card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp7-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp7-hdr { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp7-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp7-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp7-body { font-size: 12.8px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp7-vt figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
